      "line": 17,
      "text": "In this research, cubic LLZO was synthesized through a solution-based synthesis method without any extrinsic dopants at temperatures lower than 1000 ◦C. Polyvinylpyrrolidone (PVP) was used as the chelating agent, and the cubic phase was confirmed by using XRay diffraction. Finally, AC impedance measurements were conducted to evaluate the electrochemical performance of the synthesized material.",
