        }
      ],
      "context": [
        {
          "line": 31,
          "text": "The XRD patterns of the samples are shown in Fig. 2. Analyses of the patterns confirmed the cubic structure. The LLZO sample was synthesized successfully, and the XRD patterns matched well with the reference pattern obtained from the database (PDF 01-080-9103). The lattice parameter of the sample was found to be a = 12.9827 ˚A. However, peaks associated with an impurity of La0.5Zr0.5O1.75 were also observed in the XRD patterns. This impurity was formed by volatilization of Li."
        }
      ]
    }
